# LAST RULE, ON PURPOSE: the vendored id Software tree (v38.105) ships
# verbatim, so nothing above may filter it. Its GPL COPYING.txt/README.txt and
# q3asm's .txt notes fall under `*.txt`, and it carries a build.sh — both would
# otherwise be silently dropped (last match wins in gitignore, so this has to
# come after every exclusion pattern).
!third_party/q3a/**
